  "description": "*“One day, my mom turned into a monster.”*\n\nConsumed by their own traumas, people transform into monsters called “Memorians,” and eventually, the world falls apart. One day, the protagonist, Ha-Eon, struggles desperately to save his mother, who has become a Memorians, but under the strict measures of the rescue team, the “Memory Divers,” who were watching the situation, his mother ultimately falls into a coma. Ha-Eon then discovers that the culprit who ruined both the world and his mother is his father, whom he was separated from as a child, and ultimately decides to become a “Memory Diver” himself, diving into the “Sea of Memories” to save both the world and his mother.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
